      "①(pl.）情况，形势，环境：Circumstances will force us finally to adopt this policy.形势将迫使我们最终采取这种政策。",
      "②(pl.）经济情况，境况：When he explained his ~s to me, Idecided to help him.当他说明了他的境况之后，我决定帮助他。 辨析circumstance（s），surroundings environment,setting",
