     "en": "The voyage from England to Australia used to take several months.",
     "zh": "从英国到澳大利亚的航行过去要几个月的时间。"
    },
    {
     "en": "Bad news ~s quickhly.",
     "zh": "坏消息传播得很快。"
    }
